    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IAs">I As</ref> 2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Utan geþencan, hu Iacob cwæð se heahfæder: "Decimas et hostias pacificas offeram tibi"; ⁊ hu Moyses cwæð on Godes lage: "Decimas et primitias non tardabis offere Domino."</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Let us remember how Jacob the Patriarch declared: "Decimus et hostias pacificas offeram tibi"; and how Moses declared in God's law: "Decimus et primitias non tardibus offere Domino."</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Uton geþencan, hu Iacob cwæð se heahfæder: 'Decimas et hostias pacificas offeram tibi'; ⁊ hu Moyses cwæð on Godes lage: 'Decimas et primitias non tardibis offere Domino.'</ab>
      </div>
